{
  "pv36:0.1": "",
  "pv36:0.2": "",
  "pv36:0.3": "",
  "pv36:1.1": "Vesāli nāma nagar' atthi Vajjinaṃ ",
  "pv36:1.2": "tattha ahu Licchavi Ambasakkharo ",
  "pv36:1.3": "disvāna petaṃ nagarassa bāhiraṃ ",
  "pv36:1.4": "tatth' eva pucchittha taṃ kāraṇatthiko. [=36].2 ",
  "pv36:2.1": "Seyyā nisajjā na-y-imassa atthi ",
  "pv36:2.2": "abhikkamo natthi paṭikkamo vā ",
  "pv36:2.3": "asitapītakhāyitavatthabhogā ",
  "pv36:2.4": "paricāraṇā sā pi imassa natthi. [=36].3 ",
  "pv36:3.1": "Ye ñātakā diṭṭhasutā suhajjā ",
  "pv36:3.2": "anukampakā yassa ahesuṃ pubbe ",
  "pv36:3.3": "daṭṭhum pi te dāni na taṃ labhanti ",
  "pv36:3.4": "virādhitatto hi janena tena. [=36].4 ",
  "pv36:4.1": "Na oggatattassa bhavanti mittā ",
  "pv36:4.2": "jahanti mittā vikalaṃ viditvā ",
  "pv36:4.3": "atthañ ca disvā parivārayanti ",
  "pv36:4.4": "bahū ca mittā uggatattassa honti. [=36].5 ",
  "pv36:5.1": "Nihīnatto sabbabhogehi kiccho ",
  "pv36:5.2": "sammakkhito samparibhinnagatto ",
  "pv36:5.3": "ussāvabindū va palimpamāno ",
  "pv36:5.4": "ajja suve jīvitassūparodho. [=36].6 ",
  "pv36:6.1": "Etādisaṃ uttamakicchapattaṃ ",
  "pv36:6.2": "uttāsitaṃ pucimandassa sūle ",
  "pv36:6.3": "atha tvaṃ kena vaṇṇena vadesi yakkha ",
  "pv36:6.4": "jīva bho jīvitam eva seyyo ti. [=36].7 ",
  "pv36:7.1": "Sālohito esa ahosi mayhaṃ ",
  "pv36:7.2": "ahaṃ sarāmi purimāya jātiyā ",
  "pv36:7.3": "disvā ca me kāruññam ahosi rāja ",
  "pv36:7.4": "mā pāpadhammo nirayaṃ patāyaṃ. [=36].8 ",
  "pv36:8.1": "Ito cuto Licchavi esa poso ",
  "pv36:8.2": "sattussadaṃ nirayaṃ ghorarūpaṃ ",
  "pv36:8.3": "uppajjati dukkaṭakammakārī ",
  "pv36:8.4": "mahābhitāpaṃ kaṭukaṃ bhayānakaṃ. [=36].9 ",
  "pv36:9.1": "Anekabhāgena guṇena seyyo ",
  "pv36:9.2": "ayam eva sūlo nirayena tena mā ",
  "pv36:9.3": "ekantadukkhaṃ kaṭukaṃ bhayānakaṃ ",
  "pv36:9.4": "ekantatippaṃ nirayaṃ patāyaṃ. [=36].10 ",
  "pv36:10.1": "Idañ ca sutvā vacanaṃ mam' eso ",
  "pv36:10.2": "dukkhūpanīto vijaheyya pāṇaṃ ",
  "pv36:10.3": "tasmā ahaṃ santike na bhaṇāmi ",
  "pv36:10.4": "mā m' ekato jīvitassūparodho ti. [=36].11 ",
  "pv36:11.1": "Aññāto eso purisassa attho ",
  "pv36:11.2": "aññam pi icchāmase pucchituṃ tuvaṃ ",
  "pv36:11.3": "okāsakammaṃ sace no karosi ",
  "pv36:11.4": "pucchāmi taṃ na ca no kujjhitabbaṃ. [=36].12 ",
  "pv36:12.1": "Addhā paṭiñña me tadā ahu ",
  "pv36:12.2": "nācikkhanā appasannassa hoti ",
  "pv36:12.3": "akāmā saddheyyavaco ti katvā ",
  "pv36:12.4": "pucchassu maṃ kāmaṃ yathā visayhan ti. [=36].13 ",
  "pv36:13.1": "Yaṃ kiñcāhaṃ cakkhunā passissāmi ",
  "pv36:13.2": "sabbam pi tāhaṃ abhisaddaheyyaṃ ",
  "pv36:13.3": "disvāna taṃ no pi ce saddaheyyaṃ ",
  "pv36:13.4": "kareyyāsi me yakkha niyassakamman ti. [=36].14 ",
  "pv36:14.1": "Saccappaṭiññā tava m' esā hotu ",
  "pv36:14.2": "sutvāna dhammaṃ labhassu pasādaṃ ",
  "pv36:14.3": "aññatthiko no ca paduṭṭhacitto ",
  "pv36:14.4": "yan te sutaṃ asutaṃ cāpi dhammaṃ ",
  "pv36:14.5": "sabbaṃ akkhissaṃ yathā pajānaṃ: [=36].15 ",
  "pv36:15.1": "Setena assena alaṅkatena ",
  "pv36:15.2": "upayāsi sūlāvutakassa santike ",
  "pv36:15.3": "yānam idaṃ abbhutaṃ dassaneyyaṃ ",
  "pv36:15.4": "kiss' etaṃ kammassa ayaṃ vipāko. [=36].16 ",
  "pv36:16.1": "Vesāliyā tassa nagarassa majjhe ",
  "pv36:16.2": "cikkhallamagge narakaṃ ahosi ",
  "pv36:16.3": "gosīsaṃ ekāhaṃ pasannacitto ",
  "pv36:16.4": "setaṃ gahetvāna narakasmiṃ nikkhipiṃ. [=36].17 ",
  "pv36:17.1": "Etasmiṃ pādāni patiṭṭhapetvā ",
  "pv36:17.2": "mayañ ca aññe ca atikkamimha ",
  "pv36:17.3": "yānam idaṃ abbhutaṃ dassaneyyaṃ ",
  "pv36:17.4": "tass' eva kammassa ayaṃ vipāko ti. [=36].18 ",
  "pv36:18.1": "Vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsati ",
  "pv36:18.2": "gandho ca te sabbadisā pavāyati ",
  "pv36:18.3": "yakkhiddhipatto 'si mahānubhāvo ",
  "pv36:18.4": "naggo cāsi kissa ayaṃ vipāko. [=36].19 ",
  "pv36:19.1": "Akkodhano niccapasannacitto ",
  "pv36:19.2": "saṇhāhi vācāhi janaṃ lapemi ",
  "pv36:19.3": "tass' eva kammassa ayaṃ vipāko ",
  "pv36:19.4": "dibbo ca me vaṇṇo satataṃ pabhāsati. [=36].20 ",
  "pv36:20.1": "Yasañ ca kittiñ ca dhamme ṭhitānaṃ ",
  "pv36:20.2": "disvāna mantemi pasannacitto ",
  "pv36:20.3": "tass' eva kammassa ayaṃ vipāko ",
  "pv36:20.4": "dibbo me gandho satataṃ pavāyati. [=36].21 ",
  "pv36:21.1": "Sahāyānaṃ titthasmiṃ nahāyantānaṃ ",
  "pv36:21.2": "thale gahetvā nidahissa dussaṃ ",
  "pv36:21.3": "khiḍḍatthiko no ca paduṭṭhacitto ",
  "pv36:21.4": "ten' amhi naggo kasirā ca vutti. [=36].22 ",
  "pv36:22.1": "Yo kīḷamāno pakaroti pāpaṃ ",
  "pv36:22.2": "tass' īdisaṃ kammavipākam āhu ",
  "pv36:22.3": "akīḷamāno pana yo karoti ",
  "pv36:22.4": "kiṃ tassa kammassa vipākam āhu. [=36].23 ",
  "pv36:23.1": "Ye duṭṭhasaṅkappamanā manussā ",
  "pv36:23.2": "kāyena vācāya ca saṅkiliṭṭhā ",
  "pv36:23.3": "kāyassa bhedā abhisamparāyaṃ ",
  "pv36:23.4": "asaṃsayaṃ te nirayaṃ upenti. [=36].24 ",
  "pv36:24.1": "Apare pana sugatiṃ āsamānā ",
  "pv36:24.2": "dāne ratā saṅgahitattabhāvā ",
  "pv36:24.3": "kāyassa bhedā abhisamparāyaṃ ",
  "pv36:24.4": "asaṃsayaṃ te sugatiṃ upenti. [=36].25 ",
  "pv36:25.1": "Taṃ kin ti jāneyyam ahaṃ avecca ",
  "pv36:25.2": "kalyāṇapāpassa ayaṃ vipāko ",
  "pv36:25.3": "kiṃ vāhaṃ disvā abhisaddaheyyaṃ ",
  "pv36:25.4": "ko vā pi maṃ saddahāpeyya etaṃ. [=36].26 ",
  "pv36:26.1": "Disvā ca sutvā abhisaddahassu ",
  "pv36:26.2": "kalyāṇapāpassa ayaṃ vipāko ",
  "pv36:26.3": "kalyāṇapāpe ubhaye asante ",
  "pv36:26.4": "siyā nu sattā sugatā duggatā vā. [=36].27 ",
  "pv36:27.1": "No c' ettha kammāni kareyyuṃ maccā ",
  "pv36:27.2": "kalyāṇapāpāni manussaloke ",
  "pv36:27.3": "tasmā hi sattā sugatā duggatā vā ",
  "pv36:27.4": "hīnā paṇītā ca manussaloke. [=36].28 ",
  "pv36:28.1": "Yasmā ca kammāni karonti maccā ",
  "pv36:28.2": "kalyāṇapāpāni manussaloke ",
  "pv36:28.3": "tasmā hi sattā sugatā duggatā vā ",
  "pv36:28.4": "hīnā paṇītā ca manussaloke. [=36].29 ",
  "pv36:29.1": "Dvay' ajja kammānaṃ vipākam āhu ",
  "pv36:29.2": "sukhassa dukkhassa ca vedanīyaṃ ",
  "pv36:29.3": "tā devatāyo paricārayanti ",
  "pv36:29.4": "paccanti bālā dvyataṃ apassino. [=36].30 ",
  "pv36:30.1": "Na m' atthi kammāni sayaṃ katāni ",
  "pv36:30.2": "datvā pi me natthi so ādiseyya ",
  "pv36:30.3": "acchādanaṃ sayanam ath' annapānaṃ ",
  "pv36:30.4": "ten' amhi naggo kasirā ca vutti. [=36].31 ",
  "pv36:31.1": "Siyā nu kho kāraṇaṃ kiñci yakkha ",
  "pv36:31.2": "acchādanaṃ yena tuvaṃ labhetha ",
  "pv36:31.3": "ācikkha me taṃ yad atthi hetu ",
  "pv36:31.4": "saddhāyitaṃ hetuvaco suṇoma. [=36].32 ",
  "pv36:32.1": "Kappitako nāma idh' atthi bhikkhu ",
  "pv36:32.2": "jhāyī susīlo arahā vimutto ",
  "pv36:32.3": "guttindriyo saṃvutapātimokkho ",
  "pv36:32.4": "sītibhūto uttamadiṭṭhipatto. [=36].33 ",
  "pv36:33.1": "Sakhilo vadaññū suvaco sumukho ",
  "pv36:33.2": "svāgamo suppaṭimuttako ca ",
  "pv36:33.3": "puññassa khettaṃ araṇavihārī ",
  "pv36:33.4": "devamanussānañ ca dakkhiṇeyyo. [=36].34 ",
  "pv36:34.1": "Santo vidhūmo anīgho nirāso ",
  "pv36:34.2": "mutto visallo amamo avaṅko ",
  "pv36:34.3": "nirūpadhī sabbapapañcakhīṇo ",
  "pv36:34.4": "tisso vijjā anuppatto jutīmā. [=36].35 ",
  "pv36:35.1": "Appaññāto disvā pi na sujāno ",
  "pv36:35.2": "munī ti naṃ Vajjisu voharanti ",
  "pv36:35.3": "jānanti taṃ yakkhabhūtā anejaṃ ",
  "pv36:35.4": "kalyāṇadhammaṃ vicarantaṃ loke. [=36].36 ",
  "pv36:36.1": "Tassa tuvaṃ ekaṃ yugaṃ duve vā ",
  "pv36:36.2": "mam' uddisitvāna sace dadetha ",
  "pv36:36.3": "paṭiggahītāni ca tāni assu ",
  "pv36:36.4": "mamañ ca passetha sannaddhadussaṃ. [=36].37 ",
  "pv36:37.1": "Kasmiṃ padese samaṇaṃ vasantaṃ ",
  "pv36:37.2": "gantvāna passemu mayaṃ idāni ",
  "pv36:37.3": "sa-m-ajja kaṅkhaṃ vicikicchitañ ca ",
  "pv36:37.4": "diṭṭhivisūkāni vinodaye me. [=36].38 ",
  "pv36:38.1": "Eso nisinno Kapinaccanāyaṃ ",
  "pv36:38.2": "parivārito devatāhi bahūhi ",
  "pv36:38.3": "dhammiṃ kathaṃ bhāsati saccanāmo ",
  "pv36:38.4": "sakasmim ācerake appamatto. [=36].39 ",
  "pv36:39.1": "Tathāhaṃ kassāmi gantvā idāni ",
  "pv36:39.2": "acchādayissaṃ samaṇaṃ yugena ",
  "pv36:39.3": "paṭiggahītāni ca tāni assu ",
  "pv36:39.4": "tuvañ ca passemu sannaddhadussaṃ. [=36].40 ",
  "pv36:40.1": "Mā akkhaṇe pabbajitaṃ upāgami ",
  "pv36:40.2": "sādhu vo Licchavi n' esa dhammo ",
  "pv36:40.3": "tato ca kāle upasaṅkamitvā ",
  "pv36:40.4": "tatth' eva passāhi raho nisinnaṃ. [=36].41 ",
  "pv36:41.1": "Tathā ti vatvā agamāsi tattha ",
  "pv36:41.2": "parivārito dāsagaṇena Licchavi ",
  "pv36:41.3": "so taṃ nagaraṃ upasaṅkamitvā ",
  "pv36:41.4": "vāsūpagacchittha sake nivesane. [=36].42 ",
  "pv36:42.1": "Tato ca kāle gihikiccāni katvā ",
  "pv36:42.2": "nahātvā pivitvā ca khaṇaṃ labhitvā ",
  "pv36:42.3": "viceyya peḷāto ca yugāni aṭṭha ",
  "pv36:42.4": "gāhāpayī dāsagaṇena Licchavi. [=36].43 ",
  "pv36:43.1": "So taṃ padesaṃ upasaṅkamitvā ",
  "pv36:43.2": "tam addasā samaṇaṃ santacittaṃ ",
  "pv36:43.3": "paṭikkantaṃ gocarato nivattaṃ ",
  "pv36:43.4": "sītibhūtaṃ rukkhamūle nisinnaṃ. [=36].44 ",
  "pv36:44.1": "Tam enaṃ avoca upasaṅkamitvā ",
  "pv36:44.2": "appābādhaṃ phāsuvihārañ ca pucchi ",
  "pv36:44.3": "Vesāliyaṃ Licchavi 'haṃ bhadante ",
  "pv36:44.4": "jānanti maṃ Licchavi Ambasakkharo. [=36].45 ",
  "pv36:45.1": "Imāni me aṭṭha yugā subhāni ",
  "pv36:45.2": "paṭigaṇha bhante padadāmi tuyhaṃ ",
  "pv36:45.3": "ten' eva atthena idhāgato 'smi ",
  "pv36:45.4": "yathā ahaṃ attamano bhaveyyaṃ. [=36].46 ",
  "pv36:46.1": "Dūrato va samaṇā brāhmaṇā ca ",
  "pv36:46.2": "nivesanaṃ te parivajjayanti ",
  "pv36:46.3": "pattāni bhijjanti ca te nivesane ",
  "pv36:46.4": "saṅghāṭiyo cāpi vidālayanti. [=36].47 ",
  "pv36:47.1": "Athāpare pādakuṭhārikāhi ",
  "pv36:47.2": "avaṃsirā samaṇā pātayanti ",
  "pv36:47.3": "etādisaṃ pabbajitā-vihesaṃ ",
  "pv36:47.4": "tayā kataṃ samaṇā pāpuṇanti [=36].48 ",
  "pv36:48.1": "Tiṇena telam pi na tvaṃ adāsi ",
  "pv36:48.2": "mūḷhassa maggam pi na pāvadāsi ",
  "pv36:48.3": "andhassa daṇḍaṃ sayam ādiyāsi ",
  "pv36:48.4": "etādiso kadariyo asaṃvuto, ",
  "pv36:48.5": "atha tvaṃ kena vaṇṇena kim eva disvā ",
  "pv36:48.6": "amhehi saha saṃvibhāgaṃ karosi. [=36].49 ",
  "pv36:49.1": "Paccemi bhante yaṃ tvaṃ vadesi ",
  "pv36:49.2": "vihesayiṃ samaṇabrāhmaṇe ca ",
  "pv36:49.3": "khiḍḍatthiko no ca paduṭṭhacitto ",
  "pv36:49.4": "etam pi me dukkaṭam eva bhante. [=36].50 ",
  "pv36:50.1": "Khiḍḍāya yakkho pasavitva pāpaṃ ",
  "pv36:50.2": "vedeti dukkhaṃ asamattabhogī ",
  "pv36:50.3": "daharo yuvā nagganiyassa bhāgī ",
  "pv36:50.4": "kiṃ su tato dukkhatar' assa hoti. [=36].51 ",
  "pv36:51.1": "Taṃ disvā saṃvegam alatthaṃ bhante ",
  "pv36:51.2": "tappaccayā tāhaṃ dadāmi dānaṃ ",
  "pv36:51.3": "paṭigaṇha bhante vatthayugāni aṭṭha ",
  "pv36:51.4": "yakkhass' imā gacchantu dakkhiṇāyo. [=36].52 ",
  "pv36:52.1": "Addhā hi dānaṃ bahudhā pasatthaṃ ",
  "pv36:52.2": "dadato ca te akkhayadhammam atthu ",
  "pv36:52.3": "paṭigaṇhāmi te vatthayugāni aṭṭha ",
  "pv36:52.4": "yakkhass' imā gacchantu dakkhiṇāyo. [=36].53 ",
  "pv36:53.1": "Tato hi so ācamayitva Licchavi ",
  "pv36:53.2": "therassa datvāna yugāni aṭṭha ",
  "pv36:53.3": "paṭiggahītāni ca tāni c' assu ",
  "pv36:53.4": "yakkhañ ca passetha sannaddhadussaṃ. [=36].54 ",
  "pv36:54.1": "Tam addasā candanasāralittaṃ ",
  "pv36:54.2": "ājaññam ārūḷham uḷāravaṇṇaṃ ",
  "pv36:54.3": "alaṅkataṃ sādhunivatthadussaṃ ",
  "pv36:54.4": "parivāritaṃ yakkhamahiddhipattaṃ. [=36].55 ",
  "pv36:55.1": "So taṃ disvā attamano udaggo ",
  "pv36:55.2": "pahaṭṭhacitto ca subhaggarūpo ",
  "pv36:55.3": "kammañ ca disvāna mahāvipākaṃ ",
  "pv36:55.4": "sandiṭṭhikaṃ cakkhunā sacchikatvā. [=36].56 ",
  "pv36:56.1": "Tam enaṃ avoca upasaṅkamitvā: ",
  "pv36:56.2": "dassāmi dānaṃ samaṇabrāhmaṇānaṃ ",
  "pv36:56.3": "na cāpi me kiñ ci adeyyam atthi ",
  "pv36:56.4": "tuvañ ca me yakkha bahūpakāro. [=36].57 ",
  "pv36:57.1": "Tuvañ ca me Licchavi ekadesaṃ ",
  "pv36:57.2": "adāsi dānāni amogham etaṃ ",
  "pv36:57.3": "svāhaṃ karissāmi tayā va sakkhiṃ ",
  "pv36:57.4": "amānuso mānusakena saddhiṃ. [=36].58 ",
  "pv36:58.1": "Gatī ca bandhū ca parāyaṇañ ca ",
  "pv36:58.2": "mitto mamāsi atha devatā si ",
  "pv36:58.3": "yācām' ahaṃ pañjaliko bhavitvā ",
  "pv36:58.4": "icchāmi taṃ yakkha punāpi daṭṭhuṃ. [=36].59 ",
  "pv36:59.1": "Sace tuvaṃ assaddho bhavissasi ",
  "pv36:59.2": "kadariyarūpo vippaṭipannacitto ",
  "pv36:59.3": "ten' eva maṃ na lacchasi dassanāya ",
  "pv36:59.4": "disvā ca taṃ nāpi ca ālapissaṃ. [=36].60 ",
  "pv36:60.1": "Sace tvaṃ bhavissasi dhammagāravo ",
  "pv36:60.2": "dāne rato saṅgahitattabhāvo ",
  "pv36:60.3": "opānabhūto samaṇabrāhmaṇānaṃ ",
  "pv36:60.4": "evaṃ mamaṃ lacchasi dassanāya. [=36].61 ",
  "pv36:61.1": "Disvā ca taṃ ālapissaṃ bhadante ",
  "pv36:61.2": "imañ ca sūlato lahuṃ pamuñca ",
  "pv36:61.3": "yatonidānaṃ akariṃha sakkhiṃ ",
  "pv36:61.4": "maññāmi sūlāvutakassa kāraṇā. [=36].62 ",
  "pv36:62.1": "Te aññamaññaṃ akarimha sakkhiṃ ",
  "pv36:62.2": "ayañ ca sūlāvuto lahuṃ pamutto ",
  "pv36:62.3": "sakkacca dhammāni samācaranto ",
  "pv36:62.4": "mucceyya so nirayā ca tamhā. [=36].63 ",
  "pv36:62.5": "Kammaṃ siyā aññatra vedanīyaṃ ",
  "pv36:63.1": "Kappitakañ ca upasaṅkamitvā ",
  "pv36:63.2": "ten' eva saha samvibhajitva kāle ",
  "pv36:63.3": "sayam mukhen' upanisajja puccha. [=36].64 ",
  "pv36:63.4": "So te akkhissati etam atthaṃ ",
  "pv36:64.1": "tam eva bhikkhuṃ upasaṅkamitvā ",
  "pv36:64.2": "pucchassu aññatthiko no ca paduṭṭhacitto; ",
  "pv36:64.3": "so te sutaṃ asutañ cāpi dhammaṃ ",
  "pv36:64.4": "sabbam pi akkhissati yathā pajānaṃ: suto ca dhammaṃ sugatiṃ akkhissa. [=36].65 ",
  "pv36:65.1": "So tattha rahassaṃ samullapitvā ",
  "pv36:65.2": "sakkhiṃ karitvāna amānusena ",
  "pv36:65.3": "pakkāmi so Licchavīnaṃ sakāsaṃ ",
  "pv36:65.4": "ath' abravī parisaṃ sannisinnaṃ: [=36].66 ",
  "pv36:66.1": "Suṇantu bhonto mama ekavākyaṃ ",
  "pv36:66.2": "varaṃ varissaṃ labhissāmi atthaṃ ",
  "pv36:66.3": "sūlāvuto puriso luddakammo ",
  "pv36:66.4": "paṇītadaṇḍo anusattarūpo. [=36].67 ",
  "pv36:67.1": "Ettāvatā vīsatirattimattā ",
  "pv36:67.2": "yato āvuto n' eva jīvati na mato ",
  "pv36:67.3": "tāhaṃ mocayissāmi dāni ",
  "pv36:67.4": "yathāmati anujānātu saṅgho. [=36].68 ",
  "pv36:68.1": "Etañ ca aññañ ca lahuṃ pamuñca ",
  "pv36:68.2": "ko taṃ vadetha tathā karontaṃ ",
  "pv36:68.3": "yathā pajānāsi tathā karohi ",
  "pv36:68.4": "yathāmati anujānāti saṅgho. [=36].69 ",
  "pv36:69.1": "So taṃ padesaṃ upasaṅkamitvā ",
  "pv36:69.2": "sūlāvutaṃ mocayi khippam eva, ",
  "pv36:69.3": "mā bhāyi sammā ti ca taṃ avoca ",
  "pv36:69.4": "tikicchakānañ ca upaṭṭhapesi. [=36].70 ",
  "pv36:70.1": "Kappitakañ ca upasaṅkamitvā ",
  "pv36:70.2": "ten' eva saha saṃvibhajitva kāle ",
  "pv36:70.3": "sayam mukhen' upanisajja Licchavi ",
  "pv36:70.4": "tath' eva pucchittha naṃ kāraṇatthiko. [=36].71 ",
  "pv36:71.1": "Sūlāvuto puriso luddakammo ",
  "pv36:71.2": "paṇītadaṇḍo anusattarūpo ",
  "pv36:71.3": "ettāvatā vīsatirattimattā ",
  "pv36:71.4": "yato āvuto n' eva jīvati na mato, [=36].72 ",
  "pv36:72.1": "So mocito gantvā mayā idāni ",
  "pv36:72.2": "etassa yakkhassa vaco hi bhante ",
  "pv36:72.3": "siyā nu kho kāraṇaṃ kiñcid eva ",
  "pv36:72.4": "yena so nirayaṃ no vajeyya. [=36].73 ",
  "pv36:73.1": "Ācikkha bhante yadi atthi hetu ",
  "pv36:73.2": "saddhāyitaṃ hetuvaco suṇoma ",
  "pv36:73.3": "na tesaṃ kammānaṃ vināsam atthi ",
  "pv36:73.4": "avedayitvā idha vyantibhāvo. [=36].74 ",
  "pv36:74.1": "Sace sa dhammāni samācareyya ",
  "pv36:74.2": "sakkacca rattindivam appamatto ",
  "pv36:74.3": "mucceyya so nirayā ca tamhā ",
  "pv36:74.4": "kammaṃ siyā aññatra vedanīyaṃ. [=36].75 ",
  "pv36:75.1": "Aññāto eso purisassa attho ",
  "pv36:75.2": "mamaṃ pi dāni anukampa bhante ",
  "pv36:75.3": "anusāsa maṃ ovada bhūripañña ",
  "pv36:75.4": "yathā ahaṃ no nirayaṃ vajeyyaṃ. [=36].76 ",
  "pv36:76.1": "Ajj' eva buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ upehi ",
  "pv36:76.2": "dhammañ ca saṅghañ ca pasannacitto ",
  "pv36:76.3": "tath' eva sikkhāya padāni pañca ",
  "pv36:76.4": "akhaṇḍaphullāni samādiyassu. [=36].77 ",
  "pv36:77.1": "Pāṇātipātā viramassu khippaṃ ",
  "pv36:77.2": "loke adinnaṃ parivajjayassu ",
  "pv36:77.3": "amajjapo mā ca musā abhāṇi ",
  "pv36:77.4": "sakena dārena ca hohi tuṭṭho; ",
  "pv36:77.5": "imañ ca ariyaṃ aṭṭhaṅgavaren' upetaṃ ",
  "pv36:77.6": "samādiyāhi kusalaṃ sukhudrayaṃ. [=36].78 ",
  "pv36:78.1": "Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañ ca ",
  "pv36:78.2": "paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ ",
  "pv36:78.3": "annaṃ pānaṃ khādanīyaṃ ",
  "pv36:78.4": "vatthasenāsanāni ca ",
  "pv36:78.5": "dadāhi ujubhūtesu ",
  "pv36:78.6": "vippasannena cetasā. [=36].79 ",
  "pv36:79.1": "Bhikkhū ca sīlasampanne ",
  "pv36:79.2": "vītarāge bahussute ",
  "pv36:79.3": "tappehi annapānena ",
  "pv36:79.4": "sadā puññaṃ pavaḍḍhati. [=36].80 ",
  "pv36:80.1": "Evañ ca dhammāni samācaranto ",
  "pv36:80.2": "sakkacca rattindivam appamatto mucceyya ",
  "pv36:80.3": "so tvaṃ nirayā ca tamhā ",
  "pv36:80.4": "kammaṃ siyā aññatra vedanīyaṃ. [=36].81 ",
  "pv36:81.1": "Ajj' eva buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ upemi ",
  "pv36:81.2": "dhammañ ca saṅghañ ca pasannacitto ",
  "pv36:81.3": "tath' eva sikkhāya padāni pañca ",
  "pv36:81.4": "akhaṇḍaphullāni samādiyāmi. [=36].82 ",
  "pv36:82.1": "Pāṇātipātā viramāmi khippaṃ ",
  "pv36:82.2": "loke adinnaṃ parivajjayāmi ",
  "pv36:82.3": "amajjapo no ca musā bhaṇāmi ",
  "pv36:82.4": "sakena dārena ca homi tuṭṭho ",
  "pv36:82.5": "imañ ca ariyaṃ aṭṭhaṅgavaren' upetaṃ ",
  "pv36:82.6": "samādiyāmi kusalaṃ sukhudrayaṃ. [=36].83 ",
  "pv36:83.1": "Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañ ca ",
  "pv36:83.2": "paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ ",
  "pv36:83.3": "annaṃ pānaṃ khādanīyaṃ ",
  "pv36:83.4": "vatthasenāsanāni ca, [=36].84 ",
  "pv36:84.1": "Bhikkhū ca sīlasampanne ",
  "pv36:84.2": "vītarāge bahussute ",
  "pv36:84.3": "dadāmi na vikappāmi ",
  "pv36:84.4": "buddhānaṃ sāsane rato. [=36].85 ",
  "pv36:85.1": "Etādiso Licchavi Ambasakkharo ",
  "pv36:85.2": "Vesāliyaṃ aññataro upāsako ",
  "pv36:85.3": "saddho mudū kārakaro ca bhikkhu- ",
  "pv36:85.4": "saṅghañ ca sakkacca tadā upaṭṭhahi. [=36].86 ",
  "pv36:86.1": "Sūlāvuto ca arogo hutvā ",
  "pv36:86.2": "serī sukhī pabbajjaṃ upāgami ",
  "pv36:86.3": "bhikkhuñ ca āgamma Kappitakuttamaṃ ",
  "pv36:86.4": "ubho pi sāmaññaphalāni ajjhaguṃ. [=36].87 ",
  "pv36:87.1": "Etādisā sappurisāna sevanā ",
  "pv36:87.2": "mahapphalā hoti sataṃ vijānataṃ ",
  "pv36:87.3": "sūlāvuto aggaphalaṃ aphassayi ",
  "pv36:87.4": "phalaṃ kaniṭṭhaṃ pana Ambasakkharo ti. ",
  "pv36:88.1": "Ambasakkharapetavatthu paṭhamaṃ [=37].1-54 See Vimānavatthu "
}
